  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Black Box — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you have learned to manifest your barrier around yourself. You can spend 6 cursed energy as an action to manifest parts of your cube around your body like armor for 1 minute or until the armor is destroyed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You gain the hit points of your barrier as temporary hit points.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your AC equals your Dark Cube’s AC.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your unarmed strikes can use your CE modifier for attack rolls and deal 3d8 + CE modifier necrotic damage on a hit.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can spend additional cursed energy up to twice your cursed energy modifier to also gain the benefits of any reinforcement other than Size.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
